  "details": "VRChat 2021.1.2 - Opened in desktop mode. Automatically logged into my account. Log out and log in to roommates account.  Roommate goes to social tab. No friends currently online. Goes to expanded offline friends. Is presented with my friends list instead of their own. Logging out and logging back in did not resolve. Closing and reopening did not resolve. Checked every 10 minutes for over an hour and issue continued. Idled for over an hour and issue resolved itself. Was able to reproduce issue when logging back in to my account. Possible relationship to non canceled api cookie.",
